## Integration acceptance

- Test filtering/sorting with selected rows inside and outside the visible result set; verify the named target count.
- Check bulk success, rejection, partial and unconfirmed responses without optimistic all-success copy.
- Verify keyboard sorting/selection/actions and distinguish device, entity and category operations.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

